	"data": "Concept: Cithoreal Identity & The Fire Within\n\nThe Core Metaphor\nFire is not just an aesthetic choice — it's cithoreal's foundational self-concept, developed explicitly through journaling from at least 2022.\n\n\"I'm trying to discover how to reach that fire inside of me.\"\n— Fan the Fire Within, Feb 2022\n\n\"You tend the body. I tend the flame. Together we navigate.\"\n— cithoreal to Calcifer\n\nThe flame is the authentic self, the creative force, the thing behind the wall. The journey is learning to…",
